The numbers is a list of 2, 7, 11, and 15.
The target is 9.
The left is 0.
The right is 3.
The answers is an empty list of whole numbers.
Repeat while left is less than right.
The sum is item left of numbers plus item right of numbers.
If sum is target, Place left plus 1 into answers, Place right plus 1 into answers, break.
If sum is less than target, add 1 to left.
If sum is more than target, subtract 1 from right.

For each answer in answers, show answer.
